---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = 'China Visa-Free Countries List (2026) — China Starter Guide';
const description = 'Check if your country is eligible for visa-free entry to China in 2026.';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="en">
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="mb-12">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3">📋 Entry & Visa</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">
        China Visa-Free Countries List (2026)
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-6">Check if your country qualifies for visa-free entry to China.</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500">
        <span>📅 Last updated: June 11, 2026</span>
        <span>⏱️ 5 min read</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Quick Answer Box -->
    <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-green-50 to-emerald-50 border-l-4 border-green-500 rounded-r-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-green-900 mb-4">🎯 Quick Answer</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-green-800 leading-relaxed">
        <strong>Citizens of 50 countries can enter China visa-free for up to 30 days.</strong> If your country is on the list, you don't need any advance paperwork — just a valid passport. The policy covers tourism, business, family visits, and short-term cultural exchanges.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Check the list below. If your country is included in China's visa-free policy, you can enter China without applying for a tourist visa in advance — for up to 30 days per entry.
      </p>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🌍</span> Who Can Enter China Visa-Free?
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Citizens holding ordinary passports from the countries listed below can enter China without a visa for:
      </p>

      <div class="bg-green-50 border border-green-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-8 not-prose">
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-gray-700">
          <li>Tourism</li>
          <li>Business visits</li>
          <li>Family visits</li>
          <li>Short-term cultural exchanges</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-gray-700 mt-4 font-medium">
          Maximum stay: Up to 30 calendar days per visit.
        </p>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🇪🇺</span> Europe (40 countries)
      </h2>

      <div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-8 not-prose">
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-gray-700">
          <li>France</li>
          <li>Germany</li>
          <li>Italy</li>
          <li>Netherlands</li>
          <li>Spain</li>
          <li>Portugal</li>
          <li>Switzerland</li>
          <li>Ireland</li>
          <li>Austria</li>
          <li>Belgium</li>
          <li>Luxembourg</li>
          <li>Denmark</li>
          <li>Sweden</li>
          <li>Norway</li>
          <li>Finland</li>
          <li>Iceland</li>
          <li>Greece</li>
          <li>Poland</li>
          <li>Czech Republic</li>
          <li>Hungary</li>
          <li>Slovakia</li>
          <li>Slovenia</li>
          <li>Estonia</li>
          <li>Latvia</li>
          <li>Lithuania</li>
          <li>Croatia</li>
          <li>Romania</li>
          <li>Bulgaria</li>
          <li>Cyprus</li>
          <li>Malta</li>
          <li>Monaco</li>
          <li>San Marino</li>
          <li>Andorra</li>
          <li>Liechtenstein</li>
          <li>North Macedonia</li>
          <li>Bosnia and Herzegovina</li>
          <li>Montenegro</li>
          <li>Serbia</li>
          <li>Albania</li>
          <li>Russia</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🌏</span> Asia (8 countries)
      </h2>

      <div class="bg-purple-50 border border-purple-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-8 not-prose">
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-gray-700">
          <li>Singapore</li>
          <li>Malaysia</li>
          <li>Thailand</li>
          <li>Japan</li>
          <li>South Korea</li>
          <li>Brunei</li>
          <li>United Arab Emirates</li>
          <li>Qatar</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🌎</span> Americas & Oceania (2 countries)
      </h2>

      <div class="bg-orange-50 border border-orange-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-8 not-prose">
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-gray-700">
          <li>Australia</li>
          <li>New Zealand</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">❓</span> Frequently Asked Questions
      </h2>

      <div class="space-y-6 mb-8 not-prose">
        <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">How long can I stay visa-free?</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">Up to 30 calendar days per entry. If you need a longer stay, you'll need to apply for a visa or leave and re-enter.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">Can I work or study visa-free?</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">No. Visa-free entry is for tourism, business visits, family visits, and short-term cultural exchanges only. If you plan to work or study, you need the appropriate visa.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">What if my country isn't on the list?</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">Check if you qualify for the 240-hour visa-free transit policy. If not, you'll need to apply for a standard L-type Tourist Visa.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Related Guides -->
    <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">📚 Related Guides</h3>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <a href="/en/prepare/visa/visa-guide/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">China Visa Types Complete Guide</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">All visa options explained</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/en/prepare/visa/transit-240/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">240-Hour Visa-Free Transit Explained</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">10-day transit without a visa</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>